#==============================================================================================
#
#   text_node_1 - Layout::TextNode: the node of a DOM text node and its text for rendering
#
#   DESCRIPTION:
#       Port of LibWeb/Layout/TextNode.cpp (lines 1-424) and TextNode.h: the constructor, the
#       MathML italic mapping and the text-transform values, the text for rendering (with
#       segment breaks and tabs made spaces where white-space-collapse collapses them) and the
#       grapheme and line segmenters of that text.
